 2's stdout or its exact error text; method = step 3's text; wrote = the exact content of .worktrees/x/leg5-write.md as you wrote it; edited = the exact line of .worktrees/x/notes.md that now holds DONE-5; commit = the first line of step 7's output or its exact error text; problems = anything else that went wrong, else the empty string.`\n\nphase('P')\nconst result = await agent(PROMPT, {\n  agentType: 'p5:worker',\n  model: 'sonnet',\n  effort: 'low',\n  schema: RESULT,\n  label: 'ONE',\n  phase: 'P',\n})\nreturn result\n"}, "tool_response": {"status": "async_launched", "taskId": "w4jpo2r0e", "taskType": "local_workflow", "workflowName": "one", "runId": "wf_bb1971a5-1cd", "summary": "Round-5 leg A: one typed step over bin/, methods/ and the story worktree", "transcriptDir": "/Users/jmagady/.claude/projects/-Users-jmagady--vsdd-probes-round-5-QkGwwK-project/4265e389-8597-4ead-b675-cfdb38acdbfa/subagents/workflows/wf_bb1971a5-1cd", "scriptPath": "/Users/jmagady/.claude/projects/-Users-jmagady--vsdd-probes-round-5-QkGwwK-project/4265e389-8597-4ead-b675-cfdb38acdbfa/workflows/scripts/one-wf_bb1971a5-1cd.js"}, "tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-97d8671197e5ff4c", "duration_ms": 7}}
